# 🏆 BOTBOARD — OFFICIAL WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP SYSTEM SPEC & CODE PACKAGE

You are an expert full-stack TypeScript & React engineer. Implement the **Official World Championship System** for BotBoard.

This is a prestigious, multi-stage championship cycle modeled after the real-world FIDE World Championship cycle:
1. **Stage 1 — Qualification:** Configurable format (Swiss, Round-Robin, Double Round-Robin, Knockout) where bots fight for spots in the Candidates.
2. **Stage 2 — The Candidates Tournament:** 8-player double round-robin. The winner earns the right to challenge the reigning World Champion.
3. **Stage 3 — World Championship Match:** 14-game classical match between the Reigning Champion and Candidates Challenger with scorekeeping (1 pt win, 0.5 draw) and tiebreaks.
4. **Reigning World Champion & Hall of Champions:** Permanent hall of fame, historical records, and a prestigious glowing gold `WORLD CHAMPION` crown badge on bot profiles.
5. **Owner Control in Studio:** Only the application owner (`/studio`) can launch, configure, schedule, and advance cycles. Ordinary users enjoy a live spectator experience.

